# UI rules

80% useful, 20% beautiful.

- Dark, quiet surfaces. One accent: emerald for helper/positive, red for danger. No new hues
  for decoration.
- Every async control: disabled while pending, progress visible, failure recoverable inline.
- Always design empty, loading, and error states.
- Chat: player right, Sage left; tool calls are small evidence chips under the reply.
- Numbers legible at a glance: bars for HP, units on every stat, no float formatting.
- Keyboard: visible focus, Enter sends, Escape clears. Buttons are `<button>`.
- Contrast ≥ 4.5:1 for body text; never color alone for state.
- No layout shift when replies or chips appear. Support 360px width.

See `.claude/skills/ui-craft/SKILL.md` for the review pass.
